    "abstract": "For every natural number $k$, there is a finite simple graph $G$ whose\ntreewidth $\\mathrm{tw}(G)$ and twin-width $\\mathrm{tww}(G)$ satisfy\n$$\n\\mathrm{tw}(G) \\le 2k + 4\n\\qquad\\text{and}\\qquad\n2^k < \\mathrm{tww}(G).\n$$\n"
  },
